«
@@ DMOHisto — demo of the Probability section: a law drawn at random
@@ among nine, with random parameters, or the one given: a law name
@@ alone, "Gamma" or "Beta" included, or { law { params } }. 300 values
@@ (fewer if they take more than about 30 s, 30 at least, unless the
@@ global variable ExtendedTrials is not 0) drawn from it by its Rand
@@ entry into ΣData, their histogram in gray
@@ (HistogramPlot), and the density of the law over it, scaled to the
@@ counts, in black. Press again for a new law: the tagged result left
@@ on the stack is not taken as an argument (DeleteTag to replay it).
@@ The draws stay in ΣData.
@@ Author & design          : Jean Wilson
@@ Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @ The argument, if any: a list { law { params } } or a law name alone;
  @ anything else, the tagged result of a previous run included, is left
  0
  If Depth 1 > Then Drop Dup TypeName End
  → dhht
  «
  Case
    dhht "list" == Then Dup 1 Get Swap 2 Get End
    dhht "text" == Then { } End
    { "Norml" "LgNrm" "Expon" "Weibl" "TriSym" "UShape" "Rayleigh" "Logis" "Chi2" }
    RAND 9 * IP R→I 1 + Get { }
  End
  300
  → dhhn dhhq dhhcount
  «
    @ The parameters, at random when not given
    dhhq
    If dhhq Size 0 == Then
      Drop
      Case
        dhhn "Norml" == Then 0 RAND 1.5 * 0.5 + 2 RND 2 →List End
        dhhn "LgNrm" == Then 0 RAND 0.5 * 0.3 + 2 RND 2 →List End
        dhhn "Expon" == Then RAND 1.5 * 0.5 + 2 RND 1 →List End
        dhhn "Weibl" == Then RAND 2.5 * 1 + 1 RND 1 2 →List End
        dhhn "TriSym" == Then 0 RAND 2 * 1 + 1 RND 2 →List End
        dhhn "UShape" == Then 0 1 2 →List End
        dhhn "Rayleigh" == Then RAND 1.5 * 0.5 + 2 RND 1 →List End
        dhhn "Logis" == Then 0 RAND 0.5 + 2 RND 2 →List End
        dhhn "Chi2" == Then RAND 6 * IP R→I 2 + 1 →List End
        dhhn "Gamma" == Then RAND 4 * 1 + 1 RND RAND 1.5 * 0.5 + 1 RND 2 →List End
        dhhn "Beta" == Then RAND 3.5 * 1.5 + 1 RND RAND 3.5 * 1.5 + 1 RND 2 →List End
        "Give its parameters: { law { params } }" DoErr
      End
    End
    → dhhp
    «
      @ The parameters as text: "a b " for Rand, "a;b;" for PDF
      "" "" 1 dhhp Size For dhhi
        dhhp dhhi Get →Text
        → dhhv « Swap dhhv + " " + Swap dhhv + ";" + »
      Next
      → dhhr dhhs
      «
        ClΣ
        @ Up to 300 draws, but no longer than about 30 s, and 30 at least:
        @ some laws draw slowly on a calculator. ExtendedTrials other than 0
        @ asks for the 300 draws whatever the time.
        IfErr 'ExtendedTrials' Rcl Then Drop 0 End 0 ≠
        "« " dhhr + "Ⓛ" + dhhn + "Rand »" + Str→
        Ticks 0
        → dhhext dhhdraw dhhtk0 dhhk
        «
          Do
            dhhdraw Σ+
            dhhk 1 + 'dhhk' Sto
          Until
            dhhk dhhcount ≥
            dhhext Not dhhk 30 ≥ And Ticks dhhtk0 - 30000 > And Or
          End
          dhhk 'dhhcount' Sto
        »
        MinΣ MaxΣ
        → dhhlo dhhhi
        «
          dhhhi dhhlo - 0.05 *
          → dhhm
          «
            dhhlo dhhm - dhhhi dhhm +
            → dhha dhhb
            «
              @ 25 classes for 300 draws, fewer for fewer draws, 8 at least
              dhhb dhha - dhhcount √ 1.5 * IP 8 Max 25 Min /
              "« → dhhx « " dhhr + "dhhx Ⓛ" + dhhn + "PDF » »" + Str→
              → dhhw dhhpdf
              «
                @ The highest density over the range, for the vertical scale
                0 0 60 For dhhj
                  dhha dhhb dhha - dhhj * 60 / + 'dhhpdf' Rcl Eval Max
                Next
                dhhcount dhhw * * 1.35 *
                → dhhy
                «
                  @ 25 bins of width dhhw, whatever the StatsPlotBins setting
                  ClearLCD
                  dhha dhhb XRange dhhy -40 / dhhy YRange dhhw Res
                  RclΣ 0.5 Gray Foreground HistogramPlot 'Foreground' Purge
                  2 LineWidth
                  "'" dhhcount →Text + "*" + dhhw →Text + "*Ⓛ" + dhhn + "PDF(" + dhhs + "X)'" + Str→
                  FunctionPlot 'LineWidth' Purge
                  dhhn "Rand " + dhhr + "— " + dhhcount →Text + " draws" +
                  { #0d #2d 0 true false } DrawText
                  'PPAR' Purge
                  dhhn dhhp 2 →List "law" →Tag
                »
              »
            »
          »
        »
      »
    »
  »
  »
»
